# lld — lift-source

Upstream: https://github.com/conda-forge/lld-feedstock
Fork:     https://github.com/NAGAGroup/lld-feedstock
Pinned:   40f484825b0a510ff4bafe1142f72e6f0bd42a05 (conda-forge main, 2026-08-28)

LIFT, NOT SUBMODULE: we do not build this feedstock. Its content is copied
into our own core recipe, because acpp forces LLVM+clang into ONE cmake
configure and conda-forge's per-component split cannot carry it.

The LLVM linker. WHAT WE LIFT: build flags. lld is not optional for us — the
Windows clang activation sets LD=lld-link.exe and passes -fuse-ld=lld, so a
toolchain without it does not satisfy the activation contract we are copying.

TO DIFF AGAINST UPSTREAM:
    git clone https://github.com/NAGAGroup/lld-feedstock
    git -C lld-feedstock diff 40f484825b0a510ff4bafe1142f72e6f0bd42a05..origin/main
